Original commit body from c5837bd:

READMEs with paragraphs spanning multiple physical lines (Markdown soft
breaks) now extract complete sentences instead of cutting off mid-sentence.

Changes:
- Headers selected during embedding search are expanded with their following
  content paragraphs (merged together for better context during selection)
- Header markup is stripped from the final description so the elevator pitch
  reads naturally (e.g., "## catatonit ##" prefix removed)
- Sentence continuation logic extends extraction until sentence boundary found
